# Authentication Setup
RULE: Use ADC for local dev, Workload Identity Federation for CI/CD, Secret Manager for API keys.
WHY: Eliminates service account key files; reduces security risk; follows GCP best practices.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/auth-setup.md
DO: Use gcloud auth application-default login; store secrets in Secret Manager; rotate keys every 90 days
NEVER: Commit service account keys; use long-lived tokens without rotation; hardcode API keys in code
